        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>60\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 5 foot stainless steel door handle is for use on residential and commercial doors (such as storefront doors). It features an easy to grip 1-1/8\" square pull handle that is very comfortable.  The warm <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish requires little maintenance and is designed to enhance any setting where a clean, contemporary look is desired. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting for wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG443-1524-speifications.gif?v=1704354734\" width=\"587\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"60\" Modern Door Handle Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-stainless-steel-14-inch-square-door-handle\"><b>14\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>24\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>,\r\n<a href=\"/products/36-inch-square-door-handle-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>36\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/48-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>48\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Square Stainless Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 48-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/16\" (81 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/8\" (29 mm) Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
